2026-07-27T09:42:35.6035811Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6036581Z i /tmp/RtmpAN7PKz/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6036979Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6037452Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6037857Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6038481Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6039422Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:42:35.6040374Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
